'Subject: july activity driver survey\nwe are in the midst of enhancing the operations pricing model ( fka\ntransaction costing model ) and as a result the following applies :\n- do not need the hours surveys completed for july or august\n- need the activity driver surveys completed for july and august\nattached is the activity driver survey for the month of july . please fill\nout the attached activity driver survey with july numbers for your rc and\nreturn to shari mao by end of day friday , august 11 .\nduring the enhancment period ( july and august ) we will be standardizing and\nconsolidating activities across all commodities and operational functions .\nthis will result in a shorter survey and easier time assignment to activities\nfor your teams . the shorter and easier surveying process will begin with the\nseptember survey .\nplease call either me or shari mao at 39641 or 33859 , respectively for any\nclarification . thanks for your patience and help ,\njames scribner',ham
