itara deal # 151669 deal good from 1 / 1 / 00 - 1 / 31 / 00 but there is\nflow for all of february 2000 with no k . this is on the 215 k for 1 / 2000\nproduction which is the only k @ the meter .\nthanks\n- jackie -\n3 - 9497',ham
