'Subject: re : entex volumes\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - forwarded by ami chokshi / corp / enron on 02 / 09 / 2000\n01 : 29 pm - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\ncharles _ w _ allmon @ reliantenergy . com on 02 / 09 / 2000 11 : 44 : 58 am\nto : ami _ chokshi @ enron . com\ncc : royal _ b _ edmondson @ reliantenergy . com , ghanks @ ect . enron . com\nsubject : re : entex volumes\nami ,\nsorry that i haven \' t followed up yet , but we are in the middle of\nimplementing sap ( which i \' m sure\nyou have heard about ) , and haven \' t had time to put the sample report\ntogether .\nwhat i have at\npresent is a report from our scada system that must be run manually each day ,\nto get a report of\nyesterday \' s volumes , beginning and ending at 7 : 00 a . m . the problem is , until\ni\ncan revise it , the\nreport shows all of our city gate volumes for all suppliers , and i need to\ncreate a new one with only the\nhpl stations . i also want to set it up for automatic creation , to run at\napprox . 8 : 00 a . m . daily . it would\nthen be available to you for viewing via some type of bulletin board , such as\nis\ncurrently being operated\nby george perrine . i will be coordinating this effort with george in that\nregard . until i have completed the\nentire task , however , i will try to send you a daily ( 5 days per week ) report\ncreated manually , showing the\nprevious day \' s volumes for our monitored hpl stations . i am shooting for\nstarting this tomorrow .\ni have also been discussing this with royal edmondson of our gas supply\ndept . , and he wants us all\nto meet to discuss coordinating our efforts and sharing all information\nbetween\nall interested parties . he\nwill be getting back with you on this .',ham
