he sale @ blue dolphin 250 & 249 ( volume & price ) . can you print the confirmations for me ? also , sitara does not show me who the trader is for this deal , and by chance do you know who the scheduler ( s ) are ?\nthanks ,\ntess\n- - - - - original message - - - - -\nfrom : \" trochta , mary ( ml ) \" > @ enron [ mailto : imceanotes - + 22 trochta + 2 c + 20 mary + 20 + 28 ml + 29 + 22 + 20 + 3 cmltrochta + 40 dow + 2 ecom + 3 e + 40 enron @ enron . com ]\nsent : monday , april 23 , 2001 5 : 52 pm\nto : ray , tess\nsubject : march 2001 invoice\n- book 2 . xls',ham
