'Subject: monthly clean - up and bridge back for non - edi pipes\nto help avoid unify problems during bid - week we must be keeping up with the\nbusiness on the non - edi pipes throughout the month rather than wait until the\nend of the month to clean - up and bridge back . the it staff has identified\nthis as one of the things logistics could do to help them maintain reasonable\nperformance .\nplease make sure you know the status of each of your pipes and speak to the\nschedulers if you see they aren \' t keeping their data clean and bridged . i\nexpect you to keep on top of this throughout each month .\nwe are asking everyone else to work around our schedule so lets make sure we\ndo our part .\nthanks - bob',ham
