'Subject: yesterday \' s off - site\njust want to pat each of you on the back , and express my appreciation to each\nof you for taking time out of your schedules to meet yesterday . the results\nof our time exceeded my expectations in that i feel we had quality discussion\nand also identified some ideas and solutions to put in place quickly . each\nof you contributed concerns and discussion ideas in a very professional and\npositive manner . i also realize we have some follow - up to do , and would\nlike for us to schedule our next time to meet . i don \' t want to establish\nthese discussions as \" quarterly \" or \" monthly \" meetings at this point - i \' m\nnot sure what frequency would be appropriate . we can discuss it further as a\nteam . however , i know we at least one more session and i don \' t want much\ntime to elapse before we reconvene .\nyvette : would look at a time when everyone would be availble in march ,\npreferably the week of 3 / 6 , 3 / 13 or 3 / 20 . this may be difficult to schedule\nas daren will be working around a new baby , and others are working around\nvacation time . i anticipate a similar structure to yesterday \' s , but am very\nopen to other \' s ideas . please let yvette know if you some other idea .\ni also want to express my appreciation to yvette for organizing the\nafternoon . she did a great job ! ! !\nthanks to each of you ! !',ham
