n ; baumbach , david ; cotten , robert ; riley , brian ; austin , jeff ; hakemack , cynthia ; kenne , dawn ; lisa csikos / hou / ect @ enron ; fosdick , j r ; rodriguez , carlos ; gomes , stephanie ; clynes , pat ; acton , tom ; walker , robert ; weissman , george ; harris , joanne ; sweeney , christy ; tisdale , earl ; daren j farmer / hou / ect @ enron\nsubject : first deliveries - pure resources and louis dreyfus natural gas\nsee attached files',ham
