'Subject: pg & e bankruptcy case - - important\nas you may be aware , enron corp . is a member of the official unsecured creditors \' committee appointed in the pacific gas and electric company bankruptcy case . michael tribolet with the risk assessment and control group is enron \' s designated representative on the committee and he is being assisted by lisa mellencamp in the enron north america corp . legal group . please be advised that they will be restricted from disclosing certain of the information that they receive .\nattached are ethical wall procedures regarding confidential information that enron may receive as a member of the committee . it is important that you read the procedures promptly , print the employee certification attached and sign and return the employee certification to the compliance department as directed .',ham
